/// <summary>
/// Toggle a client's email subscription (retention / marketing check-in
/// emails) from the admin profile page. Sets the entity's
/// <c>RetentionRemindersOptedOut</c> to the inverse of <c>subscribed</c> via a
/// targeted single-field update — it does NOT replace the rest of the
/// document, so it is safe to call independently of the full profile save.
